# S14z (world), n: a new account (the campaign bot's new game at the title). Its lobby always plays its own story, which is
# empty at first (question 36 (b): nothing of anybody's story is copied to it); its own lobby progress (501) starts its
# online story. It never takes the gate, so it never enters o's instance.
campaign until stage=stagml11
talk until control,frames>=60
log n in its lobby
idle until frames>=120 fail key:4=1
log own empty story
campaign until stage=stagml02
log n in stagml02
idle until frames>=120
log n done
